  "title": "Molasses Marinade for Beef",
  "description": "If you have some molasses, brown sugar, ketchup, lemon juice, oregano, garlic powder, and onion powder handy, you can make your own beef marinade in just a matter of moments. This marinade is best if the meat is allowed to sit in the marinade overnight before cooking.",
